INSERT INTO `crawled_venues` VALUES (6,'vila-alba-resort','Vila Alba Resort','维拉阿尔巴度假村','Portugal','葡萄牙','Algarve','Lagoa','拉戈阿','Praia de Albandeira, Vila Alba Resort','8400-403',37.093000,-8.402490,'阿尔加维悬崖上的浪漫海滨度假村，坐拥大西洋壮丽全景','阿尔加维悬崖上的浪漫海滨度假村，坐拥大西洋壮丽全景','Vila Alba Resort — Your wedding is one of those unforgettable days, and you deserve to spend it in a place that lives up to such importance. A place with unique environments and surroundings that give a touch of exclusivity and authenticity. A place like Vila Alba Resort, which will shape all the great moments of the day!\n\nIn the heart of the Algarve, overlooking the natural arch of Praia da Albandeira, you will find this hotel that calls itself a refuge with unique and sophisticated environments, making it the ideal place to transform your big day into something simply unforgettable. Its paradisiacal location is combined with the sophistication and refinement of its services and spaces so that you can have an absolutely memorable wedding day.\n\nStarting with the moment of your union. A \"yes, I do,\" with stunning views of the sea. Could there be a better and more romantic setting? Its charm is visible in every corner, with contemporary decorations and classic touches, creating the tranquility and serenity that every detail gives it.\n\nEnjoy Mediterranean cuisine in the cozy panoramic restaurant. A spacious and elegant space that will accommodate your banquet and all your guests.\n\nAnd if you want even more comfort, the hotel has apartments and suites where everyone can spend the night. After the big party, you can enjoy and relax by the pool or head straight to the beach.','Vila Alba Resort — 您的婚礼是一生中最难忘的日子，值得在一个与之相称的地方度过。一个拥有独特环境和氛围的地方，赋予它专属感和真实感。Vila Alba Resort 正是这样的所在，将为您的每一个重要时刻赋予非凡意义。\n\n度假村坐落于 Algarve 中心地带，俯瞰 Praia da Albandeira 的天然海蚀拱门，自称是一处拥有独特而精致环境的避世之所，是让您的大日子变得难以忘怀的理想之地。天堂般的位置与服务及空间的精致考究相得益彰，让您拥有一个绝对难忘的婚礼日。\n\n从你们结合的那一刻开始——在壮丽的海景前说出\"我愿意\"。还有比这更浪漫的场景吗？它的魅力在每一个角落都清晰可见，当代装饰与经典元素交融，营造出每个细节所赋予的宁静与从容。\n\n在温馨的全景餐厅中享用美食。宽敞优雅的空间将容纳您的婚宴和所有宾客。\n\n如果您希望更多舒适，酒店设有公寓和套房供所有人过夜。盛大派对之后，您可以在泳池旁放松，或径直前往海滩。','/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-005.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-026.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-028.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-031.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-032.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-033.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-034.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-035.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-036.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-037.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-038.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-039.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-040.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-041.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-042.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-043.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-044.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/vila-alba-resort/var-045.jpg\"]','[{\"name\": \"海滨度假村\", \"name_en\": \"Beach Resort\"}, {\"name\": \"酒店\", \"name_en\": \"Hotel\"}]','[{\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Cliffside Terrace Ceremony\", \"labelCn\": \"悬崖露台仪式区\"}, {\"label\": \"Sea View Ceremony Platform\", \"labelCn\": \"海景仪式台\"}, {\"label\": \"Garden Ceremony Area\", \"labelCn\": \"花园仪式区\"}, {\"label\": \"Indoor Banquet Hall\", \"labelCn\": \"室内宴会厅\"}, {\"label\": \"Beach Wedding Area\", \"labelCn\": \"海滩婚礼区\"}], \"title\": \"Wedding Venues\", \"titleCn\": \"婚礼场地\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Premium Suite Sea View\", \"labelCn\": \"高级海景套房\"}, {\"label\": \"Premium Suite Garden View\", \"labelCn\": \"高级园景套房\"}, {\"label\": \"Deluxe Double Room\", \"labelCn\": \"豪华双人间\"}, {\"label\": \"Apartment 2 Bedrooms\", \"labelCn\": \"两卧公寓\"}, {\"label\": \"Apartment 1 Bedroom\", \"labelCn\": \"一卧公寓\"}], \"title\": \"Accommodation\", \"titleCn\": \"住宿\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Mediterranean Panoramic Restaurant\", \"labelCn\": \"地中海全景餐厅\"}, {\"label\": \"Custom Wedding Menu\", \"labelCn\": \"婚宴定制菜单\"}, {\"label\": \"Poolside Bar\", \"labelCn\": \"池畔酒吧\"}, {\"label\": \"24h Room Service\", \"labelCn\": \"24小时客房服务\"}], \"title\": \"Dining & Services\", \"titleCn\": \"餐饮与服务\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Infinity Pool\", \"labelCn\": \"无边际泳池\"}, {\"label\": \"Spa Alba Wellness Center\", \"labelCn\": \"Spa Alba 水疗中心\"}, {\"label\": \"Private Beach\", \"labelCn\": \"私人海滩\"}, {\"label\": \"Kids Club\", \"labelCn\": \"儿童俱乐部\"}, {\"label\": \"Garden Walkways\", \"labelCn\": \"花园步道\"}], \"title\": \"Leisure & Facilities\", \"titleCn\": \"休闲设施\"}]','20-200','','','+351 282 380 700','https://www.vilaalbaresort.com/','https://www.weddingwire.com/destination-wedding/destination/vila-alba-resort--e2192132','WeddingWire',5000,'€',10,'2026-08-20 16:58:12'),(11,'chateau-de-la-pascalette','Château de la Pascalette','拉斯卡莱特城堡','France','法国','Provence','La Londe-les-Maures','拉隆德莱莫尔','Route Départementale 559, La Londe-les-Maures, 83250','83250',43.129400,6.220020,'A 19th-century Provençal estate between vineyards and the Mediterranean','十九世纪普罗旺斯庄园，坐拥葡萄园与地中海风光','Nestled in a natural setting between vineyards and the Mediterranean, Château de la Pascalette opens its doors to a rare and authentic venue to celebrate the most beautiful day of your life. Located within a Provençal wine estate steeped in character, this château elegantly combines the timeless charm of Provence, a preserved heritage, and services designed to host exceptional weddings.\n\nBuilt in the 19th century, the Château de la Pascalette embodies all the charm and elegance of Provençal heritage. A testament to an era when grand, characterful residences set the rhythm of life on wine estates, the château has survived the centuries while preserving its authenticity and soul. With its distinctive stonework, sun-drenched landscapes, and breathtaking views of the vineyards and the Îles d\'Or, the estate offers a romantic and exclusive setting for an unforgettable celebration.\n\nThe estate offers three exclusive reception areas: The Terrace, a bright and open space ideal for cocktails and outdoor moments; The Castle\'s Salons, elegant lounges with panoramic views of the vineyards and the Îles d\'Or; and The Great Hall, a spectacular space beneath the castle blending ancient vaulted ceilings with modern comforts. Each space can be arranged according to your wishes to create a completely personalized reception.\n\nTo extend the magic of your celebration, the Château de la Pascalette has 60 beds on site. The domain offers no time limitations for your reception, allowing you to celebrate in complete freedom. Ideally located in the heart of the Var, with easy access from Toulon-Hyères airport (15 minutes) and major cities.','Château de la Pascalette — 坐落于葡萄园与地中海之间的天然胜境，这座普罗旺斯葡萄酒庄园内的19世纪城堡，将普罗旺斯永恒的魅力的、保存完好的历史遗产与专为非凡婚礼打造的服务完美融合。\n\n城堡建于19世纪，体现了普罗旺斯大宅的全部魅力与优雅。历经百年岁月，依然保留着其独特的灵魂与真实性。特色的石材建筑、阳光充沛的风景、俯瞰葡萄园和金色岛屿的全景，每一刻都充满魔幻色彩。\n\n场地提供三个专属接待空间：露台——明亮开阔的户外空间，适合鸡尾酒会和户外聚会；城堡沙龙——优雅精致的室内空间，坐拥葡萄园和金色岛屿的全景；大宴会厅——位于城堡下方的壮观空间，古老拱形天花板与现代舒适设施完美融合。每个空间均可按您的意愿定制布置。\n\n场地拥有60个床位，且无任何时间限制，让您尽情享受婚礼的每一刻。地理位置优越，距土伦-耶尔机场仅15分钟车程，交通便利。','/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-005.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-026.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-028.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-031.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-032.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-033.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-034.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-035.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-036.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-037.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-pascalette/clp-038.jpg\"]','[{\"name\": \"Château\", \"name_cn\": \"城堡\"}, {\"name\": \"Wine Estate\", \"name_cn\": \"葡萄酒庄园\"}, {\"name\": \"Historic Mansion\", \"name_cn\": \"历史庄园\"}]','[{\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Château Terrace\", \"labelCn\": \"城堡露台\"}, {\"label\": \"Castle Salons\", \"labelCn\": \"城堡沙龙厅\"}, {\"label\": \"Great Hall\", \"labelCn\": \"大宴会厅\"}, {\"label\": \"Pool Beach Ceremony Area\", \"labelCn\": \"泳池沙滩仪式区\"}], \"title\": \"Reception Spaces\", \"titleCn\": \"接待空间\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"5 Guest Rooms\", \"labelCn\": \"5间精品客房\"}, {\"label\": \"6 Gîtes\", \"labelCn\": \"6栋度假屋\"}, {\"label\": \"60 Beds On Site\", \"labelCn\": \"60个床位\"}], \"title\": \"Accommodation\", \"titleCn\": \"住宿\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"32-Hectare Vineyard\", \"labelCn\": \"32公顷葡萄园\"}, {\"label\": \"Olive Groves\", \"labelCn\": \"橄榄树林\"}, {\"label\": \"Îles d\'Or Sea View\", \"labelCn\": \"金色岛屿海景\"}, {\"label\": \"Provençal Gardens\", \"labelCn\": \"普罗旺斯花园\"}], \"title\": \"Landscape & Grounds\", \"titleCn\": \"自然景观\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"No Time Restrictions\", \"labelCn\": \"无时间限制\"}, {\"label\": \"Bespoke Wedding Planning\", \"labelCn\": \"定制婚礼策划\"}, {\"label\": \"Organic Wine Tasting\", \"labelCn\": \"有机葡萄酒品鉴\"}, {\"label\": \"Customizable Spaces\", \"labelCn\": \"个性化空间布置\"}], \"title\": \"Services & Features\", \"titleCn\": \"服务与特色\"}]','60 couchages','','','+33 6 82 10 54 91','https://chateaupascalette.com/','https://www.weddingwire.com/destination-wedding/destination/chateau-de-la-pascalette--e2232310','WeddingWire',12000,'€',0,'2026-08-25 13:44:19'),(13,'chateau-de-vergieres','Château de Vergières','韦尔吉耶尔城堡','France','法国','Provence','Saint-Martin-de-Crau','圣马丁德克罗','Chemin d\'Istres à l\'Etang des Aulnes, 13310 Saint-Martin-de-Crau','13310',43.571400,4.819210,'A 25-hectare Provençal estate between Alpilles and Camargue','普罗旺斯25公顷庄园，坐落于阿尔皮勒与卡马格之间','Château de Vergières — Celebrate your union in Provence, surrounded by nature, meadows of La Crau, and century-old plane trees. This exceptional 25-hectare estate offers peace and authenticity between the Alpilles and the Camargue.\n\nThe estate features a magnificent reception barn (La Grange) with timber frame and Crau pebble walls, accommodating up to 400 guests. Additional spaces include the former stables, wine cellar, and covered terrace. Your cocktail party can be held entirely outdoors in the gardens under the stars.\n\nThe Château itself offers 23 guest bedrooms and suites for an exclusive overnight stay. The property embodies the soul of Provence: stone buildings, bicentennial plane trees, the song of cicadas, and a warm atmosphere where every detail breathes authenticity.','Château de Vergières — 在普罗旺斯的自然怀抱中庆祝您的结合，这里有拉·克劳的草地和百年梧桐树。这座非凡的25公顷庄园位于阿尔皮勒与卡马格之间，宁静而纯正。\n\n庄园拥有一座宏伟的接待谷仓（La Grange），木结构和克劳鹅卵石墙可容纳多达400位宾客。此外还有旧马厩、酒窖和带顶露台。鸡尾酒会可以在星空下的花园中 entirely 户外举行。\n\n城堡本身提供23间客房和套房，供宾客尊享过夜住宿。庄园体现了普罗旺斯的灵魂：石砌建筑、两百年梧桐树、蝉鸣声，以及每个细节都散发纯正气息的温暖氛围。','/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-005.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-026.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-028.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-031.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-033.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-034.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-035.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-036.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/cdv-037.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-vergieres/c