},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"家具与装饰\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Furniture & Decorations\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"24盏专业灯光\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"24 Professional Lights\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"无开瓶费\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"No Corkage Fee\\\"}]},{\\\"titleCn\\\":\\\"户外特色\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Outdoor Features\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"25公顷庄园\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"25-Hectare Estate\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"百年梧桐大道\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Century-old Plane Tree Alleys\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"浪漫凉亭\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Romantic Kiosk\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"法式小酒馆区\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Guinguette Area\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"游泳池\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Swimming Pool\\\"},{\\\"labelCn\\\":\\\"星空下花园\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Gardens Under the Stars\\\"}]}]\"','Up to 400','','','+33 4 90 47 17 16','https://www.chateaudevergieres.com/','https://www.weddingwire.com/destination-wedding/destination/chateau-de-vergieres--e2211030','WeddingWire',11000,'€',100,'2026-08-25 14:44:28'),(14,'chateau-de-tresserve','Château de Tresserve','特雷塞尔城堡','France','法国','Savoie','Tresserve','特雷塞尔','205, Bord du Lac, 73100 Tresserve','73100',45.671200,5.893900,'A 16th-century lakeside château on the shores of Lac du Bourget','布尔歇湖畔16世纪城堡，阿尔卑斯山间的婚礼圣地','Château de Tresserve — Nestled on the shores of Lac du Bourget in the French Alps, this prestigious 16th-century château has been entirely reconstructed and renovated while preserving its authenticity. The estate offers a unique setting for weddings, seminars, and memorable events.\n\nThe château features multiple reception spaces including the Salle du Lac with panoramic lake views, elegant salons, a bar-club with dance floor, and a fully equipped professional kitchen. Capacity extends to 220 guests seated, with dedicated spaces for ceremonies, cocktails on park terraces, and evening celebrations.\n\nThe property boasts 12 luxurious bedrooms and suites, including a nuptial suite with lake view and steam shower. A one-hectare park with century-old trees, ornamental basins, and a romantic gloriette provides a stunning backdrop for your celebration.','Château de Tresserve — 这座享有盛誉的16世纪城堡坐落于法国阿尔卑斯山布尔歇湖畔，经过全面重建和翻新，在保留其纯正性的同时焕发新生。庄园为婚礼、研讨会和难忘活动提供了独特的场地。\n\n城堡拥有多个接待空间，包括可俯瞰湖景的 Salle du Lac、优雅沙龙、带舞池的酒吧俱乐部，以及设备齐全的专业厨房。可容纳220位宾客就座，设有专门的仪式空间、公园露台上的鸡尾酒区和晚间庆祝区域。\n\n庄园拥有12间豪华卧室和套房，包括享有湖景和蒸汽淋浴的新娘套房。一公顷的公园内古树参天、装饰喷泉和浪漫凉亭，为您的庆典提供令人惊叹的背景。','/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-026.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-028.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-tresserve/cdt-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-d