Château Saint-Laurent — Celebrate your wedding in a haven of nature, elegance and serenity in Provence. The estate spans 50 hectares, blending a 5-hectare landscaped park and a 30-hectare organic vineyard. Just minutes from Avignon, between Mont Ventoux and the Alpilles, this rare venue opens its gates for a timeless weekend.\n\nEvery detail is designed to elevate your union: a ceremony under a century-old plane tree, a cocktail facing the vines, a dinner under the stars. The estate includes Le Gîte (12 guests) and La Villa (14 guests, 280 m²), plus nuptial and deluxe suites. Total accommodation: 30 guests.','Château Saint-Laurent — 在普罗旺斯的自然、优雅与宁静中庆祝您的婚礼。庄园占地50公顷，融合了5公顷的景观公园和30公顷的有机葡萄园。距阿维尼翁仅几分钟车程，位于蒙旺图与阿尔皮耶之间，这座独特的庄园让您度过一个超越时光的周末。\n\n一切都为了让您的结合更加完美：百年梧桐树下仪式，面对葡萄园鸡尾酒，星空下晚宴。庄园包含民宿（12人）和别墅（14人，280平方米），以及蜜月套房。总住宿30人。','/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-005.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-saint-laurent/csl-019.jpg\"