17 double rooms, each with a private bathroom.','Domaine La Plume — 坐落于蓝色海岸前阿尔卑斯山区，是举办各类私人活动的理想场所。这座意大利风格别墅前身为拉佩讷侯爵狩猎行宫。\n\n庄园坐落于9公顷公园和永续农业农场中，170平方米室内接待厅可容纳80人入座（最多150人站立）。带凉棚的露台适合鸡尾酒会，百年梧桐树大道提供魔幻的仪式场地。庄园拥有17间双人客房，各带独立浴室。附近另有补充住宿。','/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-005.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-026.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-028.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-031.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-032.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plume/dlp-033.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/domaine-la-plum