onceived as an urban oasis, the venue combines the charm of a natural haven with the elegance of a Cannes villa. Ideal for a ceremony, sunset cocktail or starlit dinner. The property features 6 apartments and 1 main villa, offering 25 elegant bedrooms.','Les Jardins d\'Arlias — 隐匿于戛纳市中心的私密瑰宝，距海滨大道仅几步之遥。由La Villa Alexandra打造，在翠绿优雅的环境中，这座私人花园为亲密精致的婚礼提供独特氛围。\n\n作为城市绿洲，将自然魅力与戛纳别墅优雅完美结合。适合仪式、日落鸡尾酒会或星空晚宴。物业拥有6间公寓和1栋主别墅，共25间优雅卧室。','/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/les-jardins-darlias/jda-031.jpg\"]','[{\"name\": \"Garden\", \"name_cn\": \"花园\"}, {\"name\": \"Villa\", \"name_cn\": \"别墅\"}, {\"name\": \"Terrace\", \"name_cn\": \"露台\"}]','[{\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Private garden\", \"labelCn\": \"私人花园\"}, {\"label\": \"Reception hall\", \"labelCn\": \"接待大厅\"}, {\"label\": \"Terrace\", \"labelCn\": \"露台\"}, {\"label\": \"Dance floor\", \"labelCn\": \"舞池\"}, {\"label\": \"Swimming pool\", \"labelCn\": \"游泳池\"}, {\"label\": \"Ceremony space\", \"labelCn\": \"仪式区\"}, {\"label\": \"Parking\", \"labelCn\": \"停车场\"}], \"title\": \"Spaces\", \"titleCn\": \"场地空间\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"6 apartments\", \"labelCn\": \"6间公寓\"}, {\"label\": \"1 main villa\", \"labelCn\": \"1栋主别墅\"}, {\"label\": \"25 bedrooms total\", \"labelCn\": \"25间卧室\"}], \"title\": \"Accommodation\", \"titleCn\": \"住宿\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Banquet\", \"labelCn\": \"宴会服务\"}, {\"label\": \"Decoration\", \"labelCn\": \"装饰服务\"}, {\"label\": \"Photography\", \"labelCn\": \"摄影服务\"}, {\"label\": \"Boat rental\", \"labelCn\": \"游艇租赁\"}, {\"label\": \"Paddle court\", \"labelCn\": \"Paddle球场\"}], \"title\": \"Services\", \"titleCn\": \"服务\"}]','Up to 300','',NULL,'+33 651 977 652','https://lesjardinsdarlias.com/','https://www.mariages.net/domaine-mariage/les-jardins-darlias-by-la-villa-alexandra--e390133','Mariages.net',9000,'€',0,'2026-08-25 17:01:44'),(22,'chateau-de-la-faye','Château de la Faye','拉法耶城堡','France','法国','Charente','Nonac','诺纳克','Château de la Faye, Deviat, Nonac, 16190','16190',45.411400,0.017900,'A 13th-century castle on a 500-hectare estate, 35 minutes from Angoulême','13世纪城堡，坐落于500公顷庄园，距昂古莱姆35分钟','Château de la Faye — Wild elegance: an exceptional 13th-century setting to celebrate your wedding, 35 minutes from Angoulême and 40 minutes from Cognac. The estate extends over 500 hectares of unspoiled nature.\n\nThe reception room accommodates up to 95 guests for a seated meal, with two majestic fireplaces facing each other. The estate offers 11 rooms for 27 people: 5 guest rooms in the castle and a separate cottage with 6 double rooms. Features include an outdoor pool area, indoor pool with sauna, and a pond as ceremony backdrop. The castle is entirely privatizable with a 3-day exclusive use package.','Château de la Faye — 原始野性的优雅，庆祝婚礼的非凡场所。距昂古莱姆35分钟、干邑40分钟，城堡向您敞开13世纪庄园大门，占地500公顷。真正的绿色天堂。\n\n接待厅可容纳95人入座。两座宏伟壁炉面对面。11间客房容纳27人：城堡内5间和独立小屋6间双人房。特色包括户外泳池区、带桑拿室内泳池和池塘仪式背景。城堡可完全私有化，提供3天独家套餐。','/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-005.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/chateau-de-la-faye/cdf-020.jpg\"]','[{\"name\": \"Castle\", \"name_cn\": \"城堡\"}, {\"name\": \"Historic\", \"name_cn\": \"历史建筑\"}, {\"name\": \"Park\", \"name_cn\": \"公园\"}]','[{\"items\": [{\"label\": \"500-hectare estate\", \"labelCn\": \"500公顷庄园\"}, {\"label\": \"Reception room (95 seated)\", \"labelCn\": \"接待厅（95人）\"}, {\"label\": \"Two majestic fireplaces\", \"labelCn\": \"两座壁炉\"}, {\"label\": \"Large terrace\", \"labelCn\": \"大型露台\"}, {\"label\": \"Stone facades & oak flooring\", \"labelCn\": \"石材外墙与橡木地板\"}], \"title\": \"Spaces\", \"titleCn\": \"场地空间\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"Wooded park\", \"labelCn\": \"林地公园\"}, {\"label\": \"Outdoor pool area\", \"labelCn\": \"户外泳池区\"}, {\"label\": \"Indoor pool with sauna\", \"labelCn\": \"室内泳池带桑拿\"}, {\"label\": \"Pond\", \"labelCn\": \"池塘\"}, {\"label\": \"Century-old trees\", \"labelCn\": \"百年古树\"}], \"title\": \"Outdoor\", \"titleCn\": \"户外\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"5 castle guest rooms\", \"labelCn\": \"城堡5间客房\"}, {\"label\": \"Cottage with 6 double rooms\", \"labelCn\": \"独立小屋6间双人房\"}, {\"label\": \"Total 27 guests\", \"labelCn\": \"总容纳27人\"}], \"title\": \"Accommodation\", \"titleCn\": \"住宿\"}, {\"items\": [{\"label\": \"3-day exclusive package\", \"labelCn\": \"3天独家套餐\"}, {\"label\": \"Entirely privatizable\", \"labelCn\": \"完全私有化\"}, {\"label\": \"Customizable offers\", \"labelCn\": \"可定制方案\"}, {\"label\": \"Vendor recommendations\", \"labelCn\": \"推荐供应商\"}], \"title\": \"Services\", \"titleCn\": \"服务\"}]','Up to 95','','500 hectares','077-003-9544','https://www.chateau-de-la-faye.fr/','https://www.weddingwire.com/destination-wedding/destination/chateau-de-la-faye--e2233222','WeddingWire',6500,'€',0,'2026-08-25 17:01:44'),(23,'la-tresoriere','La Trésorière','拉特雷索里耶尔庄园','France','法国','Occitanie','Maureilhan','莫雷扬','Domaine La Trésorière, Maureilhan, 34370','34370',43.347100,3.105200,'A magnificent 5-hectare estate in Hérault, 20 minutes from the beaches','埃罗省壮丽5公顷庄园，距海滩20分钟','La Trésorière — A magnificent 5-hectare estate in the Hérault department, 20 minutes from the beaches, offering a natural and authentic setting for your big day.\n\nThe estate accommodates up to 250 guests seated in the heart of a magnificent park. In addition to the greenhouse and courtyard, a nomadic tent adds an exotic touch. Seven new apartments accommodate up to 44 guests. The bridal suite includes a 40 m² bedroom, a private SPA with jacuzzi and sauna, and a shaded terrace. A large heated swimming pool completes the offer.','La Trésorière — 埃罗省莫雷扬的壮丽5公顷庄园，距海滩20分钟，在自然纯粹的环境中庆祝您的大日子。\n\n庄园可容纳250人入座。除温室和庭院外，游牧帐篷增添异国情调。7间新公寓容纳44位宾客。新娘套房含40平方米卧室、私人SPA（按摩浴缸+桑拿）和遮阳露台。大型恒温泳池。','/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-000.jpg','[\"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-000.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-001.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-002.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-003.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-004.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-006.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-007.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-008.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-009.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-010.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-011.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-012.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-013.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-014.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-015.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-016.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-017.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-018.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-019.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-020.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-021.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-022.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-023.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-024.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-025.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-026.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-027.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-028.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-029.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-030.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-031.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-032.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-033.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-034.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-035.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-036.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-037.jpg\", \"/uploads/crawled/la-tresoriere/ltr-038.